From 449d422945af670db80a2798ead7044fadbee8be Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscapeA <escapea@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 13:35:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(web): remove workflow from the frontend

Drop the whole workflow surface from the SPA (server modules untouched):

- delete WorkflowView (5.5k lines), the components/hermes/workflow directory
  (AgentNode, ConditionEdge, FieldHelp, ModelSelector, types), the workflow
  api client + status socket and the ten workflow utils
  (canvas, history, import, approval-key, run-budget, run-pager,
  run-snapshot, edge-authoring, edge-condition, skills)
- drop the /hermes/workflow route and turn the conversation switch back
  into a two-way switch (single chat / history)
- strip the workflow approval pipeline from GlobalPendingActions
  (status socket subscription, notification/sound keys, workflow-* action
  kind, node approval buttons and workflow deep links)
- drop the workflow deep CSS from App.vue and repoint the ModelsView
  profile aria-label at profiles.title
- remove the workflow i18n namespace (~470 keys) and sidebar.workflow
  from all 11 locales
- keep the workflow session source ('workflow' in chat store/api) so
  existing workflow sessions still render correctly
